#. それが、私の発言にどう関わってくるのかしら？
#. それとも…何も考えていないの？
msgctxt "0001 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"What does that have to do with what I said? Or do you\n"
"just not know what you're doing?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう一度、よく考えてみるんだ。
#. どこかにこの議論の矛盾が隠されているはず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to think about it one more time. There must be\n"
"a contradiction in there somewhere...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. なによ苗木！　口挟まないで！
msgctxt "0003 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "C'mon, Makoto! Don't clam up now!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう一度、よく考えてみるんだ。
#. どこかにこの議論の矛盾が隠されているはず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to think about it one more time. There must be\n"
"a contradiction in there somewhere...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. な、何よ…
#. 私のどこが間違っているっていうのよ…
msgctxt "0005 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Wh-What? You think s-something I said is wrong?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう一度、よく考えてみるんだ。
#. どこかにこの議論の矛盾が隠されているはず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to think about it one more time. There must be\n"
"a contradiction in there somewhere...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>黒幕…つまりモノクマを操っていた人物だ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The mastermind—the one controlling Monokuma...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だとすると、<CLT><CLT 3>黒幕がいる場所<CLT><CLT 4>って…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4><CLT><CLT 3>Where is the mastermind<CLT><CLT 4>...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>黒幕は、間違いなく
#. この<CLT><CLT 3>学園の中<CLT><CLT 4>にいるはずだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'm positive they're <CLT><CLT 3>somewhere in this school<CLT><CLT 4>.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そうでないと、
#. <CLT><CLT 3>あれを操る事<CLT><CLT 4>だって出来なかったはずだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Otherwise, there's no way they could have <CLT><CLT 3>controlled\n"
"that machine<CLT><CLT 4>...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
